Rule 17 (If the shape of v_1 is (a, b) and the shape of v_2 is (a, c), then v_1 and v_2 can be used)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 2) ∧ (ndim(v_2) = 2) ∧ (shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0))
>>
Rule 19 (Input tensors should have a positive shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0) ∧ (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) > 0)
